#: Kfi.cpp:45
msgid ""
"As this is the first time this module has been run as \"root\", it has tried to "
"guess appropriate settings for your system. When the module appears, please "
"have a look at the \"Settings\" page and check that these are ok. If not, make "
"the appropriate changes and click the \"Apply\" button."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie is die eerste tyd hierdie module het al hardloop as \"root\", dit "
"het probeer na skat geskikte instellings vir jou stelsel. Wanneer die module "
"verskyn, asseblief het 'n kyk na die \"instellings\" bladsy en bevestig wat "
"hierdie word goed. As nie, maak die geskikte verander en kliek die \"Wend aan\" "
"knoppie."

