#: rc.cpp:26
msgid ""
"AFMs (Adobe Font Metrics) are files that\n"
"may be used by programs (such as\n"
"StarOffice) to obtain detailed \"metrics\"\n"
"(e.g. sizes) of each character in a font -\n"
"so that it may be displayed/printed\n"
"correctly.\n"
"\n"
"AFMs may only contain one encoding,\n"
"so here you can specify which one\n"
"should be used."
msgstr ""
"Afms (Adobe Skrif tipe Matriks) word lêers wat\n"
"dalk mag wees gebruik word deur programme (soos as\n"
"Staroffice) na verkry gedetaileerde \"Matriks\"\n"
"(e.g. grotes) van elke karakter in 'n Skrif tipe -\n"
"sodat wat dit dalk mag wees vertoon/printed\n"
"korrek.\n"
"\n"
"Afms dalk mag slegs bevat een enkodering,\n"
"sodat hier jy kan spesifiseer wat een\n"
"moet wees gebruik word."

